    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "This beautiful 3 bedroom semi-detached residence is an ideal family home situated in Grange Rath, Drogheda, Co. Meath. The well planned and spacious interiors are flooded with natural light and extends to c. 109 sq m (c. 1,173 sq.ft.). The living room and kitchen/dining areas are of generous proportions and good dimensions. 29 Parkwood is a quality home in a prime family location within easy access of schools, shopping, the M1 Motorway and bus routes into both Drogheda and Dublin city centre. Located within a stroll of South Gate Shopping Centre, Grange Rath is situated just off the Dublin Road where you have a multitude of transport options to and from Drogheda Town, East Meath & Dublin City Centre."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hallway\r\nLiving Room\t\t(3.38m x 5.49m)\r\nKitchen\t\t(5.52m x 3.47m)\r\nDining Area\t\t(2.38m x 5.58m)\r\nUtility\t\t\t\r\nGuest WC\t\t\r\n\r\n1st Floor\r\nLanding\r\nBedroom 1\t\t(3.40m x 4.72m)\r\nEn Suite\t\t\r\nBedroom 2\t\t(3.20m x 4.28m)\r\nBedroom 3\t\t(3.25m x 2.22m)\r\nBathroom\t\tFully Tiled walls & Floor."
      },
      {
