        "Content": "3 Bedroom Semi-detached\r\nC. 109 sq.m. (c. 1,173 sq.ft.)\r\nG-F-C-H\r\nWindows upgraded and replaced\r\nTimber flooring throughout\r\nLandscaped Rear Garden\r\nFully Alarmed\r\nOwn Driveway / parking on curtilage"
